# Downloading the ML-32M dataset


- URL: https://movielens.org/

# JD click dataset

From the repository root, run:

    bash dataset/jd.sh

The pipeline downloads and verifies the source, then preprocesses it into
dataset/jd/utilities.bin. Raw click counts are retained as utilities, and the
Julia loader normalizes the selected budgets to sum to 1.

Data utilities:

- jd_download.py: resumable download and checksum verification.
- jd_preprocess.py: click aggregation and sparse binary output.
- jd-data.jl: Julia loader for selected user cohorts.

Data checks (no GPU required):

    python3 dataset/test-jd-preprocess.py
    julia dataset/test-jd-data.jl

See scripts/linear/JD.md for the experiment setup and GPU comparison.
